{"id":"wb-7-1205","name":"西关清真寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西关清真寺 (博爱县)","text":"西关清真寺位于中华人民共和国河南省焦作市博爱县西关村，是一座采用中式传统木构庭院和殿堂形式的清真寺。寺内大门、拜殿和大殿覆蓝色琉璃瓦，砖砌照壁及木构件以牡丹、荷花、菊花和云纹等为主要装饰题材。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%85%B3%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%8D%9A%E7%88%B1%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":95427287,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427287","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4a306db409a361880d86c37a.jpg","title":"20230512_Bo'ai_Xiguan_Mosque_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230512_Bo%27ai_Xiguan_Mosque_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/20230512_Bo%27ai_Xiguan_Mosque_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Bo'ai Xiguan Mosque","width":320,"height":213}}